      <cyrillic>дэргэд</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DERGEDE</transcript>
      <definition>postpos. At, by,by the side of, alongside; around, in the neighborhood, near.</definition>
      <page>253</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ ᠪᠠᠷᠠᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠪᠣᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- baraγ-a bolxu</transcript>
          <definition> To be in the presence of a sovereign, ruler or a high lama.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠭᠦᠳᠡᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>egyden y --</transcript>
          <definition> Near the door</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠢᠨᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>minu – </transcript>
          <definition>In my presence, before me, beside me</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠢᠨᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ ᠠᠪᠴᠤ ᠢᠷᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>minu – abcu ire!</transcript>
          <definition> Bring (something) to me!.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠢᠨᠤ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠲᠤᠭᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>minu – saγutuγai!</transcript>
          <definition> Seat yourself beside me !. Stop at my place</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠭᠠᠯᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>xaγalγ-a jin -- sa-yuxu</transcript>
          <definition> To sit down at the gate</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠰᠠᠬ ᠤᠨ ᠭᠠᠵᠠᠷ ᠤᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠺᠠᠳᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>zasaγ un γazar un -- </transcript>
          <definition> Belonging to or controlled by the government.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
